Natural Earth
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The bundled gazetteer table in analysis/geo/data/ is Apache OpenNLP's
derivation of the Natural Earth "Populated Places" dataset. Natural
Earth is in the public domain; made with Natural Earth.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
GeoNames
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Some record ids, coordinates and populations in the hand written test
table analysis/goldens/data/fixtures/gazetteer-geonames.txt are those
GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/) gives for the places, used under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License. No GeoNames data is
bundled with the gazetteers; callers supply GeoNames tables themselves.

